            "review_text": "Anthony K\nBrighton, United Kingdom53 contributions\n0\nLovely, friendly bar with great craft beer\nAug 2019 • Solo\nThis is a delightful small craft beer pub, with its own brewery (the Golden Perch brewery) and loads of bottled and draft ales. Super friendly staff Long and Thu completed a great evening. All of you beer fans should definitely pay Evenstar - which is Hobbit themed - a visit.\nExcellent.\nWritten August 20, 2019",
