            "review_title": "Review at Evenstar Craft Beer Pub",
            "review_text": "winter\nHanoi, Vietnam612 contributions\n0\nGreat experience\nJul 2019 • Couples\nOne of my favourite pubs in Hanoi. Evenstar has a warm, cozy atmosphere with a good food menu (very cheap lunch specials too) and very attentive staff. They have their own in-house brew called Golden Perch, which, like the pub itself has a strong Lord of the Rings theme. There are six golden perch beers on offer, the ones I tried were of very good quality. The staff were happy to make recommendations and give tasting samples, making my experience at Evenstar outstanding. Evenstar has a large selection of bottled beers from all over Vietnam and also quite a few options on tap, making it a great place to sample all the liquid delights this country has to offer.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 18, 2019",
