            "review_text": "우석 김\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nAmazing craft beer in Hanoi. 베트남 최고의 수제 맥주\nDec 2017 • Solo\nAs a beer mania, i am so happy to find such an amazing craft beer pub hanoi. This pub provides diverse type of craft beer. I think golden ale and IPA are really good. If someone misses really good beer in vietnam, id like to recommend this pub. You'll never regret. Price is around 50000 vnd~ 80000 vnd. Ita worth to drink it because you can experience what the good Vietnamese is.\n\n베트남 수제 맥주가 뭔지를 경험해보시고 싶은 분들한테 추천해용. 골든에일이 진짜 신기하게 계속 땡기는 맛이네요. 허. 한국가서 팔아야 하는데\nRead more\nWritten December 27, 2017",
